# MODULE COCK six cell static admission proof
# PURPOSE reject out of range pointer travel and unbalanced pointer loops before guest execution
# INPUT one command byte followed by A5 guard for each instruction
# INPUT terminate with zero command and its A5 guard
# OUTPUT one status byte where one means admitted and zero means rejected
# TAPE twelve cells per lexical loop frame with dynamically growing frame stack
# TAPE frame tracks status and guest pointer plus its loop entry pointer
# LIMITATION this checker supports only the documented six cell bounded guest profile
# LIMITATION requires independent exact byte count and trusted host stream closure
# LIMITATION conservative rejection of loops whose source does not restore pointer
# LIMITATION no runtime guest fuel and no dynamic tape allocation in the interpreter

